# Secrets and rendered output. Only the templates are committed.
#
# provider.toml is in this list twice over: it is rendered, AND it carries this
# provider's Nostr private key inline. The repository root's .gitignore already
# refuses `/provider.toml`; this one refuses the rendered copy here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
provider.toml
connector.toml
operator-bearer.token
operator-write.keys
nginx/conf.d/
*.key
*.secret
